From cfac582628917cdc1eb4db7a55e8a05889c9003f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:56:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! logging: structure SHA256 implementation and hardware
 entropy startup

Remove terminal per-producer JSON field/type/message conversion assertions. Preserve every preceding real RPC, file, restart, rejection and privacy assertion; remove now-unused schema reader helpers/imports only. No production code or lasting logging framework tests changed. Source syntax/Ruff/diff checks only; functional test NOT_RUN.

Preserved behavior: RPC cookie failures reject startup without leaking authentication material.
---
 .../feature_logging_crypto_startup.py         | 58 +------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 57 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_crypto_startup.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_crypto_startup.py
index a81cca6f4c875090c40cb222c2a72e524d207e44..59038a7e815ec852cbd93db5a9d05604e315b270 100644
--- a/test/functional/feature_logging_crypto_startup.py
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_crypto_startup.py
@@ -2,9 +2,7 @@
